title: MobLedger
oneLiner: Field journal for mob loot — drop rates, copper, locations, and kill coords.
icon: icon.png

---

Killing mobs builds a journal of what they drop, how often, and where you killed them. Each drop shows what a vendor pays, and that price updates when you sell the item.

`/ml` opens the journal. Zones open into subzones, and either can be hidden and restored.
